{"t":"ALLE","made":"2026-11-14 00:19","name":"Allegion plc","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Security & Protection Services","employees":13300,"hq":"Dublin, Ireland","website":"https://www.allegion.com","summary_en":"Allegion plc engages in the provision of security products and solutions worldwide. It is operating through two segments: Allegion Americas and Allegion International. The company offers door controls, door control system, and exit devices; doors, glass and door systems, and accessories; electronic security products and access control systems, including time, attendance, and workforce productivity; and locks, locksets, portable locks, and key systems. It also provides services and software, such as inspection, maintenance, and repair services for its automatic entrance solutions; software as a service, including access control, platform integration, and workforce management solutions; and ongoing aftermarket services, and design and installation offerings. In addition, the company sells its products and solutions to end-users in commercial, institutional, and residential facilities, including education, healthcare, government, hospitality, retail, commercial office, and single and multi-family residential markets under the CISA, Interflex, LCN, Schlage, SimonsVoss, and Von Duprin brands. It sells its products and solutions through distribution and retail channels, such as specialty distribution, e-commerce, and wholesalers, as well as through various retail channels comprising do-it-yourself home improvement centers, online and e-commerce platforms, and small specialty showroom outlets. Allegion plc was incorporated in 2013 and is based in Dublin, Ireland.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Allegion plc는 전 세계적으로 보안 제품 및 솔루션을 제공하고 있습니다. Allegion Americas와 Allegion International이라는 두 부문을 통해 운영되고 있습니다. 이 회사는 도어 제어, 도어 제어 시스템 및 출구 장치를 제공합니다. 문, 유리 및 문 시스템, 액세서리; 시간, 출석 및 인력 생산성을 포함한 전자 보안 제품 및 액세스 제어 시스템; 자물쇠, 자물쇠 세트, 휴대용 자물쇠 및 열쇠 시스템. 또한 자동 출입 솔루션에 대한 검사, 유지 보수 및 수리 서비스와 같은 서비스 및 소프트웨어를 제공합니다. 액세스 제어, 플랫폼 통합 및 인력 관리 솔루션을 포함한 서비스로서의 소프트웨어; 지속적인 애프터마켓 서비스, 설계 및 설치 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 회사는 CISA, Interflex, LCN, Schlage, SimonsVoss 및 Von Duprin 브랜드로 교육, 의료, 정부, 접대, 소매, 상업 사무실, 단독 및 다가구 주택 시장을 포함한 상업, 기관 및 주거 시설의 최종 사용자에게 제품과 솔루션을 판매합니다. 전문 유통, 전자상거래, 도매업체 등 유통 및 소매 채널뿐만 아니라 DIY 주택 개조 센터, 온라인 및 전자상거래 플랫폼, 소규모 전문 쇼룸 매장으로 구성된 다양한 소매 채널을 통해 제품과 솔루션을 판매합니다. Allegion plc는 2013년에 설립되었으며 아일랜드 더블린에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":189.06,"mcap":16077053952.0,"pe":23.514925,"fpe":18.634752,"peg":2.149,"ps":3.6614482,"pb":7.338146,"ev_ebitda":16.254,"div":1.16,"beta":0.824,"hi52":195.42,"lo52":125.0},"fin":{"rev":4390900224.0,"rev_g":0.096,"eps_g":0.188,"gross":0.45086,"op":0.21795,"net":0.15739,"roe":0.33556998,"fcf":580987520.0,"cash":388100000.0,"debt":2224399872.0,"de":102.394,"eps":8.04,"feps":10.14556},"own":{"short":0.0294,"inst":1.02143,"insider":0.00225},"analyst":{"n":11,"mean":193.63635,"median":196.0,"high":206.0,"low":180.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.90909,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":6,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":1,"buy":6,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":5,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":4,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":181.0,"priorPriceTarget":170.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-26","Firm":"Goldman Sachs","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":206.0,"priorPriceTarget":182.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-23","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":183.0,"priorPriceTarget":170.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-23","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"